{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. A suitcase is positioned on the top side and left side of the scene. The suitcase is located to the left of a pair of headphones, and they are aligned horizontally. The suitcase is positioned above a handbag, and the handbag is positioned above a wallet which is located on the bottom side; these three items are aligned vertically. The handbag is also located to the left of a hammer, with which it is horizontally aligned. The hammer is positioned above a wrench, and they are aligned vertically. The wrench is to the left of a remote, and they are aligned horizontally. Finally, for every spoon present, it is located above the remote and aligned vertically with it.",
